    "uid": "2078923382269524731",
    "title": "Supabase Backend + Retool Dashboard Developer (with Wix Experience)",
    "ciphertext": "~022078923382269524731",
    "description": "I’m building Good Boy Petey, a modern pet‑care platform that gives every pet a digital identity and lets rescues, vets, groomers, and owners seamlessly share records. The mobile app is already built in Lovable — now I need a developer to build the platform layer behind it.\n\nI’m looking for a full‑stack web developer who is comfortable with Supabase, Retool dashboards, and Wix. The scope is small, clear, and well‑defined. You’ll build a lightweight backend, simple partner dashboards, and clean Wix pages that connect everything together.\n\nWhat you’ll build\nA Supabase backend with tables for pets, organizations, records, transfers, and users\n\nSupabase Auth + Row Level Security so each partner only sees their own pets\n\nAPI endpoints the mobile app will call (GET pet, GET records, POST claim, POST notes)\n\nPartner dashboards in Retool for rescues, vets, and groomers\n\nBasic Wix pages for partner onboarding + login links to dashboards\n\nWhat I’m looking for\nSomeone who communicates clearly and works efficiently\n\nSomeone who has real Supabase experience (auth, RLS, APIs)\n\nSomeone who can build simple, functional dashboards in Retool\n\nSomeone comfortable making clean, modern Wix pages\n\nSomeone who can work within a 2–4 week timeline\n\nWhy this project is great to work on\nThe scope is tight and well‑defined — no endless feature creep\n\nYou’ll build something meaningful that helps rescues and pet owners\n\nYou’ll work directly with a founder who moves fast and gives clear direction\n\nYou’ll have autonomy to build clean, simple solutions without bureaucracy\n\nYou’ll see your work go live quickly — the app launches soon\n\nThis is a perfect project for a developer who enjoys building lightweight, real‑world tools with modern tech. If you’re strong with Supabase and Retool, this will be a smooth, enjoyable build.",
